---
import "../styles/legal.css";
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Nav from "../components/Nav.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import { company, seo } from "../content/site";

const updated = "September 29, 2026";
---

<Base title={seo.terms.title} description={seo.terms.description} path="/terms">
  <Nav />
  <main class="legal">
    <div class="aurora"></div>
    <div class="wrap">
      <article class="glass legal-card reveal">
        <span class="label">Legal</span>
        <h1>Terms of Use</h1>
        <p class="legal-meta">Last updated {updated} · {company.legalName} ({company.brand})</p>

        <p>
          These Terms of Use govern your access to the River Apps marketing website and related public pages
          operated by {company.legalName}. Separate terms, order forms, or product agreements may apply to
          Smart Refill, River for Business, River Mobile, Mylaundry.ph, Mycarwash.ph, MyGym.ph, and other paid or
          authenticated services.
        </p>

        <h2>1. Acceptance</h2>
        <p>
          By using this website, you agree to these Terms and our{" "}
          <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>. If you do not agree, do not use the site.
        </p>

        <h2>2. What River provides</h2>
        <p>
          River builds software that helps local businesses—such as water refilling stations, laundry shops,
          carwashes, and gyms—digitize operations, and River Mobile to connect households with those providers.
          River Tech was founded in {company.foundedYear} together with Smart Refill. Content on this marketing
          site is informational and may describe products that are live, in beta, or planned.
        </p>

        <h2>3. Partner inquiries</h2>
        <p>
          Submitting the partner interest form is not a contract. It authorizes River to contact you about
          onboarding, pricing discussions, and product updates. Any commercial relationship starts only when
          both parties agree in a separate writing or accepted product terms.
        </p>

        <h2>4. Acceptable use</h2>
        <p>You agree not to misuse the site, including by attempting to disrupt service, scrape content at scale
          without permission, introduce malware, or use the site for unlawful purposes.</p>

        <h2>5. Intellectual property</h2>
        <p>
          River names, logos, product names (including Smart Refill and River Mobile), and site content are
          owned by {company.legalName} or its licensors. You may not use them without prior written permission,
          except for ordinary linking to public pages.
        </p>

        <h2>6. Disclaimers</h2>
        <p>
          The site is provided “as is.” We do not warrant that marketing descriptions are complete or that
          planned features will launch on any stated date. Nothing on this site is legal, financial, or
          professional advice.
        </p>

        <h2>7. Limitation of liability</h2>
        <p>
          To the fullest extent permitted by Philippine law, {company.legalName} is not liable for indirect,
          incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages arising from use of this marketing site.
          Product-specific agreements may set different limits for authenticated services.
        </p>

        <h2>8. Governing law</h2>
        <p>
          These Terms are governed by the laws of the Republic of the Philippines. Courts in Metro Manila
          have exclusive jurisdiction over disputes arising from this marketing site, unless a product agreement
          says otherwise.
        </p>

        <h2>9. Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about these Terms:{" "}
          <a href={`mailto:${company.contactEmail}`}>{company.contactEmail}</a>
        </p>

        <a class="legal-back" href="/">← Back to River Apps</a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Base>
